f55"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="2e456249-2503-4bc8-89c6-4ebdafdd64ba"><p data-ref="dce8092a-3b00-44c5-875b-1984c32aa4b8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a program to create an AVL tree using a provided set of elements stored in a file. Implement operations for inserting and deleting elements from the AVL tree. After constructing the tree, output the contents of the tree in in-order traversal to a new file.</p><p data-ref="826d0afe-1a3e-427f-b532-7154259f2b48" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="2ba288a0-808b-4533-8e03-d38b218701fd"></p><p data-ref="8cf3df71-f875-46a7-abd7-5ff1aaccc767" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="18a08392-9204-494f-88d0-331b177ca89d">Note: </strong>Refer to visible test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="b599713d-7aa4-4a43-ad08-aa42fe651040" data-split-to="b599713d-7aa4-4a43-ad08-aa42fe651040" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 