le="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="dcbe51c7-c9cf-46b2-9e13-c542625f1f37" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="5bc69415-c14f-4aef-a0ef-c164c2f1c70f"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="31c1109e-4599-4e83-bc46-e7f6f90fd8c4"><p data-ref="89fba182-8704-4a6b-84c2-a5c07a0f3fd7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to construct a B-Tree of a given minimum degree. First, insert a list of keys into the B-Tree and print the inorder traversal after all insertions. Then, delete a given set of keys from the B-Tree and again print the inorder traversal. Finally, search for a specific key in the current B-Tree and print whether it is found or not.</p><p data-ref="f0de0e55-0ea6-402c-a42e-331bc4a5a74b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="cfb8d417-c1db-4ca9-ba3b-64ffa56b6105"></p><p data-ref="665b5746-5f2f-4f5d-a7b6-c0a9a690b4fc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="f8de97b8-44e3-4b15-a2f4-610a6b440e1a">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="ad2a0047-b44b-4389-ab0a-cdf5b2adc4e7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="2828bc01-c1a0-4a52-9ddf-f21e0b1cd0dd">The first line contains a single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="2097feb9-d2ef-48b5-9951-d973dd9f8246" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="193cceaf-5054-4405-ae3c-bc71aeb52607"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="91dedc2b-3462-499d-bea3-8ee9d2a57e77"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D461 TEX-I" data-ref="b20eceaa-fdf1-4e7e-9056-334bcf785505"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="be42a219-a723-4611-b415-1d67f2348327"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="3a2014a4-0673-40fc-a1f8-6b09fc8603f0"><mi data-ref="5839114d-66c0-4d8c-98ed-9098cfffe58a">t</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, the minimum degree of the B-Tree.</li><li data-ref="85eb465a-755b-4f59-9e6d-c35970a84dd8">The second line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="c08c209f-a754-4b3f-a8b7-19a8b904a126" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="a2d8de3f-b7d7-4e0e-bba1-4043e28ec5d4"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="030f097f-82ca-4408-9bf3-26d480485f5f"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="b174ad24-17aa-4e29-9e91-ee936d0d1e67"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="2fe613ed-2927-4140-a9ec-f376c99f8e0c"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="3f71acca-7662-43c9-ad2b-3ca851c46a36"><mi data-ref="f1ba0f2c-ef95-4443-bd0e-50188845bdfd">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of keys to be inserted.</li><li data-ref="a1084956-9f62-4a4a-b737-e8e4d14077e7">The third line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b5a67f28-8069-4e54-ae36-e03b9b8a5fd4" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="384d3c8e-7ef6-4ded-9ecd-5547c163c76e"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="58f6dadc-1ce5-444c-a6d0-66c48d78b906"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="542fd833-0e02-4488-8344-f5073dd55aac"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="dd95f284-919a-4f50-a9f8-206e0ccbe34b"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="9a2b5633-4091-45a2-996f-e57c53df429f"><mi data-ref="13fbf0a9-c99b-44e1-9533-106fe29aa276">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers — the keys to be inserted into the B-Tree.</li><li data-ref="b682db80-6b8e-49e4-a824-50ca6f27ca6d">The fourth line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="96f9fa84-8dd5-439a-a59c-b492489ffb68" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="6d54ef94-057f-49e6-8285-1a250d7832d9"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="7ae52543-279a-49b6-b6db-20c2b948cedc"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D451 TEX-I" data-ref="30ee2ed1-b4be-43c7-b1ea-974834271024"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="33a8c233-ba6e-49f3-9a42-eefc2c9fd743"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="faee520e-f8b7-4fba-b44e-3da2ba558346"><mi data-ref="d7f09480-720c-45db-81e5-9309a364f0b0">d</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, the number of keys to delete.</li><li data-ref="d22017d8-a1b8-42c6-95e3-a61a32a51d1d">The fifth line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="cf574295-2812-43ee-84f0-47b5709156d9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="decb38b3-eabf-4e15-b558-ff964d59c13b"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="fb478a7e-859a-4b9d-9a00-b21714fa45b0"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D451 TEX-I" data-ref="feb18aa5-8c04-40d0-8154-bf73996a9639"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="b6cd7b18-0a3c-4563-af53-ec1476a10bc4"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="16a492bc-530e-4e1b-8741-cb47c1b48315"><mi data-ref="1dac8336-acaa-42e0-a3fe-1f9ff7e3dfa1">d</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers — the keys to be deleted from the B-Tree.</li><li data-ref="d068bef7-748e-4dbc-990d-2b65efacca16">The sixth line contains a single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="55a6ca8b-cb8b-4d1b-a830-dd51e50cc462" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="ed47035c-3636-4df4-9810-344e968ceff5"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="fadc2218-86d8-4e15-83d9-14b679b68f0d"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="03f3df65-d400-4588-bac0-f589bdf45cfb"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="0b65fe31-d7a2-48e6-ba62-54bc29afc5b1"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="95ba5167-adb9-4f1d-9104-a2cadb01cfe9"><mi data-ref="e8d5e3c6-f51b-4316-9bba-b7240b81dc22">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> — the key to be searched in the B-Tree.</li></ul><p data-ref="b2c40bb1-34d3-4f84-b612-c7459d0c50a7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d3eff058-2ffb-4654-a5d5-bd561373379a"></p><p data-ref="60e20346-4556-4e7e-a852-aa41fd14ea62" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="87129386-4f10-48d6-9243-5ee3af1ea3ca">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="9a9ec8e5-5a13-40c3-b2bc-4e63d607ed7f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="5160b9d6-e9d8-4ccf-b4c0-53a5ab8e8d40">The first line of output should display the inorder traversal of the B-Tree after all insertions, with each key separated by a space.</li><li data-ref="bf5630c4-8c13-4ed1-8e6e-6e64f75be10d">The second line should display the inorder traversal of the B-Tree after all deletions, with each key separated by a space.</li><li data-ref="08d39ea9-0141-41f9-b724-f8a075a45b51">The third line should print <strong data-ref="00c5972b-2feb-405e-8341-d08f9020df07">Found</strong> if the search key exists in the B-Tree. If the key is not present, print <strong data-ref="c5cc38d4-a08c-4dd7-b8de-26ce3b074135">Not Found</strong> instead.</li></ul><p data-ref="99904e46-3c80-442c-8bc3-235b4ade8a0e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="5c9f51bc-4e91-4d17-946a-ea5e5e58afcc"></p><p data-ref="ecea3f42-7f5c-447a-aa3c-d626ee40aa3c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="819093d2-0f09-423a-b131-fb8e1551b338"></p><p data-ref="8a917fe0-83bf-4190-9018-fd538fc92814" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a99f537a-0f4d-44bc-9f8d-9eb14653a17b">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="4b130858-839d-4650-b7a0-c2a6a9e84393" data-split-to="4b130858-839d-4650-b7a0-c2a6a9e84393" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="ef02af9e-f152-4ccc-b173-78fffa116d40"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="fbc9cecd-7fec-4f3f-a755-046ba86fa1e3" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
