			<div class="pagedjs_area">
				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-from="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-to="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0"><div class="page" data-ref="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-from="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-to="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01"><div data-ref="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-split-to="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="95561525-95e1-4f3f-bb9f-61e432e76991" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="95561525-95e1-4f3f-bb9f-61e432e76991" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="ea79a47a-8581-4c47-814c-ae929edceca9"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="217c097e-aa8c-4cdf-b2e6-cd21f6dd7231"><thead data-ref="71bbcb01-142e-4b37-a068-4260239c3634"><tr data-ref="0fec4f81-6850-4d42-978a-2a4c6bfa8134"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="9b95bcb2-9581-4ee3-90a6-71b1a3a56841" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 3</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="782dc296-84f6-485e-b561-b2b9459a79de" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="c4146403-462f-488d-9880-427807da77d9"><i data-ref="57d175bc-1239-4b14-b037-f2f5ed502770">Min Heap Operations</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="c0e34820-fa35-476f-bf72-12054417e171" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-08-28</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="2b0fd378-e159-4bed-920f-f51462fb1332" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="4488ac3a-01d2-42e8-831c-f8a888e06e15" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="085a27fb-e793-42a0-9057-d5e277f7afb3"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="c3881810-1a82-4af1-9db2-2b2ef14337cd"><p data-ref="9ef5e388-6710-4d54-a05e-8b6149cf92c1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to implement a Min Heap of integers. The program should first read a list of integers and insert them into the heap while maintaining the min-heap property. It should then read the number of deletions to perform, delete the root (minimum element) that many times, and display the heap both before and after the deletions.</p><p data-ref="12ddc867-2fcb-4ce0-86a7-a0cbc811e42b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d0b429e0-511a-4581-9f80-b1d9fae91644"></p><p data-ref="3bf56593-2ee4-442a-aa81-3e1a9476d1c1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a0e312d1-b020-4a54-8370-57d25d37da40">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="f8483107-671b-424b-acf0-5fab5ef6e813" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="af5ff047-f6a1-4c3b-9420-bdbe639f69a4">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="19f062f3-3425-457f-be6d-af0ec2a892ae" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="161f29c6-fdc7-4bc8-bc87-4f2149d4a729"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="754cab7b-ba53-4ae3-8134-3a8451ef0946"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="9c5297a2-5458-4425-affb-c3fcb8366f79"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="bb2efc7f-ff8e-4e7c-92ce-fe9b3e28f434"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="5ef7b252-25ac-4e29-bdff-bcde1b5eb1bd"><mi data-ref="62851e78-4e4b-42d0-aeea-6540489ea433">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of elements to insert into the heap.</li><li data-ref="8a825a0e-040d-4b69-aaf2-6b8140e63a69">The second line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="15a28c1d-8b63-4ad6-a2be-ccd17f71a7fc" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="8bfb99e4-d6a9-49fc-a211-e2cd72e60fcd"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="4adfae16-3b05-4811-93ab-05d8ca32f35e"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="c7f809a8-73a4-4dc6-b7b8-bf3c40fe8764"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="df91e7a8-7bfe-4466-b663-5e535e6a1f52"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="a055af9a-a1ac-450e-b4f5-3569786f8742"><mi data-ref="42d776a1-d66d-47de-a2ce-5589ec8ec740">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers — the values to insert into the heap.</li><li data-ref="516a58fd-e0f9-4cea-a25d-0859ebfde57a">The third line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="a13fcaac-4be6-4211-be5c-fc5e96dc8340" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="619e7eb5-1727-445c-a81e-ccdca4f48934"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="52472205-6c93-40e5-9842-76bfa330facd"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="5488ca89-6778-4aae-914a-9f39c74481d4"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="af8a2327-de78-43a0-bd6a-f6842fa1f479"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="f474f027-231f-44f9-b0aa-dd54bcd778fc"><mi data-ref="2d34f5b1-e9bd-44b5-9a40-f1b10080b8c2">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of times the root (minimum element) should be deleted from the heap.</li></ul><p data-ref="d1613b38-c246-4d39-a90b-965f284a0173" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="852a0b89-b682-4da7-8505-ffcf9299ebbb"></p><p data-ref="c598aaac-15c3-4f19-a6a4-3ea1d763191a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a4e2b226-2b15-4efc-8159-96ad41c2b865">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="5d899dc8-7e1d-418b-89e8-5415ecbce367" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="856a514d-ed29-49b4-8bd8-a621fcff9140">The first line displays the space-separated heap contents after all insertions.</li><li data-ref="307e23ba-9067-4014-967c-5901fa3db7d7">The second line displays the space-separated heap contents after performing <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="a855b565-7b74-4285-bad2-27f1bb80c218" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="81710fc3-88c4-4003-893c-ed6d942e1d34"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="211eda73-992d-431e-92a1-66464ec706a8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="a7ecc1bd-019f-4eaf-94b5-c3deb0dd0522"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="8fa4e9fe-51bf-44fd-9ce8-11a2b56fa7b4"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="2dd5935a-cd6d-4883-8238-ee160fe7c637"><mi data-ref="41e5933c-b849-4258-b073-beb1313ee5f0">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> deletions of the root element.</li></ul><p data-ref="9ab230c8-78b5-4704-949e-dfdfc146cc22" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="5f33b94c-a850-4f8c-981b-4263d8bddde4"></p><p data-ref="f145d05f-d19b-49e8-a786-9423995a3ddc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="70bb97d9-df39-455d-b534-a9ba5e97e8c9">Note:</strong> Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="41ce2353-f34f-47b2-9570-05a519abd3ac" data-split-to="41ce2353-f34f-47b2-9570-05a519abd3ac" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="72133041-13d0-4346-abf2-f96d24c0ba6b"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="04659c93-c67d-4fd4-a28a-cc6d0d702c32" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
