;" data-ref="693b74a7-937a-4041-89f3-fe4d4394f77a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="6c5cd798-ee70-4fce-8a5b-b9789b0eb361"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="81c93ec5-8748-4394-8e8d-b5ace01097c3"><p data-ref="5ab646ca-e436-4702-83f0-f6715397da42" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to implement a Max Heap. Insert a given list of integers into the heap while maintaining the max-heap property. Then, delete the root element (i.e., the maximum element) a specified number of times. Display the heap after all insertions and again after the deletions.</p><p data-ref="fe4fb4ec-d3ed-4a38-99bb-fbb3b1948362" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b979727b-9286-4604-8de2-9720b49614c1"></p><p data-ref="815c9299-455b-4ab7-b225-07b81188baea" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="289944c1-b173-4f73-a35a-342990ea461b">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="6de6bb4c-9e46-49c7-a676-451a74ffe69d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="a913de1f-a078-47a9-b3b8-dd8aea6635ed">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="6492464e-816e-43c5-b9bb-ec6e48c6cdad" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="9e743264-6537-44f0-b36f-b58dbf867db5"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="4f93bf00-87d5-41dc-8a2d-4c32604eadbe"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="63e98322-442c-459e-909d-71fa89e158e3"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="d1fcc417-025f-46ff-abc0-4b62869f3a48"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="644567cc-c5cc-4fa8-92aa-bf31ce7219bb"><mi data-ref="c08f81ee-7bed-4dd1-8cc8-548cd405c8d3">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, the number of elements to insert into the heap.</li><li data-ref="f09a7fe3-f946-4ffa-9dcd-5252a705e64a">The second line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="a6506f7e-74ba-4d1d-ac74-12af1c62bc23" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="8876e2f3-817c-4859-a5e9-24fd9982820e"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="3c0590f7-b674-4091-b6ff-60fbfc8c04f2"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="9b523ead-90b7-481a-afc4-9a54224478f0"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="28f04005-cc90-4dcc-91d8-c10275f196a1"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="523cbf41-4026-4017-941f-f7d9d4bc820d"><mi data-ref="ab6e6413-e95c-4b22-8166-2e0c8c8a2af5">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers representing the values to be inserted.</li><li data-ref="60e9ea32-515d-45e3-8427-f544a6f56f16">The third line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="5da6e93e-1d08-4ebb-83fb-a0f25f1364ac" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="54d86be1-3ff0-43d9-823e-00d4571b0dcc"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="621cac14-44db-4bb9-913b-6c8b6dad17dd"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="963f88a6-cafe-42e6-a574-de0dce6a9a5b"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="347b8863-9f1d-431e-87a2-1df084a5e82b"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="7344a54b-0aeb-4974-9974-f6bdd944382b"><mi data-ref="768b0f26-4ac8-4d29-8b0e-5cbb04f7d91c">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, the number of times the root element (maximum) should be deleted.</li></ul><p data-ref="57327b7e-bffa-4593-b9ee-b511a24bffd2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="053726c6-7a94-4884-89b9-97bd70da3f68"></p><p data-ref="7eac1e7c-e1e6-4543-a354-d3b5a6ac8dbd" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="ed684b14-4572-447c-8981-5b21c81f6bb7">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="1ca0e3ae-70c2-4138-928b-234ddac142f4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="7badf4b2-025c-4b09-96e8-2d1f7cf4b9c4">The first line displays the space-separated heap contents after all insertions.</li><li data-ref="14286761-f396-449d-8ab7-30421851f687">The second line displays the space-separated heap contents after performing <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b68281c1-ef42-477c-b9de-13b45227eae9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="5c0583d7-50f2-4a4f-a8b2-ee96100ca6f0"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="2906f765-5faa-42d6-b503-a61a978d1a3f"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="966f830f-713d-4fdf-807f-608ee76e0792"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="9bfd0eb6-c577-4fb2-b037-2990b0132b6a"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="93d3f7d1-5014-4349-8d65-5a5e34a75770"><mi data-ref="a87b8405-9882-44dc-b6d6-52b4485315c7">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> deletions of the root element.</li></ul><p data-ref="3ee271a9-d464-4a50-8512-254f0ebb18da" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="2ce34199-4886-4f6f-949f-63d5d9a2603f"></p><p data-ref="5997116d-2b44-4bb7-a407-fe6af2a7b76c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset=