:1px solid black;" data-ref="171fe217-6573-4739-96e3-b6ebbefd81dc" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="96f81d51-138d-47de-830a-eec339e747ab"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="fb3e9026-051f-4b4f-a0e5-bea5aa52cf0c"><p data-ref="4e4bf60e-9a5c-4116-9a3c-33ababb081eb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a program to perform Depth First Search (DFS) traversal on an undirected graph using an adjacency matrix representation. The program should take the number of vertices, edges, and the starting vertex as input and print the DFS traversal of the graph.</p><p data-ref="0036377d-8bf3-4968-9c66-758fdeb2edb2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="26719ca6-1425-4f34-bf2b-b5ba2da7e252"></p><p data-ref="41fc7073-69f1-4760-b7d0-8b4b9a9591d9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="901e93f8-866d-402b-863c-720f122b622b">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="ca51ff68-7908-43bb-a86e-31334b9c4f5f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="28a23c07-0d79-4b9c-b147-29ee877b1ddf">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="515f4c66-40af-4e2e-92e9-0b03dcc80067" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="84ae7cb7-00ff-4a6e-aa41-ab14b1cd7df6"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="6cdccda6-997c-4814-bb84-871c6dc883a3"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="8b847fc7-1821-4a47-b91b-6677b3b7f1d9"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="8339f45b-0475-49d3-a0c5-8eeb5df988aa"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="b227a849-5b6d-4940-97a3-8c3249e7fa5c"><mi data-ref="f03b18d8-9bdb-47f5-bceb-226de56a41fc">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of vertices in the graph.</li><li data-ref="de2ff7e4-f82e-47b6-9023-1755b15eafbe">The second line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="2b1189bf-cd79-4916-81d5-2aaaca0eb9d2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="dde82433-d04a-4109-95a1-96246c1decd3"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="d90bc5b8-3a8d-47df-b122-9c2e6ebb203a"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="c4ede95f-c0cb-444b-a822-111d39b890c5"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="0106f0e5-f82a-427f-bc34-0db4f5365092"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="e5e406ea-4f2c-4de4-9d09-850cad2db5df"><mi data-ref="f767a046-2f90-4d24-ba87-a35432b50e7a">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of edges in the graph.</li><li data-ref="c884fe09-5cdd-44d8-8806-f8c99b106539">The next <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="0d560074-0c78-45cb-b14d-613a7f7377c3" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="c1dc5e3c-2ac0-4525-84ca-35b37d8a0ea4"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="fbe962c5-f7e2-4d72-b997-2cb8faa76ad9"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="3f131946-2e7a-4e95-8637-aca7d42e7a48"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="b56a2c36-8809-41ef-a323-36dfdb386860"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="5fcadc25-4d71-42cc-92e4-cd04ebdd429c"><mi data-ref="216977ab-4747-47f2-b799-c5c5595d7548">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lines contain two integers <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="4cf76982-1006-447e-a70e-1fd6e0ae881f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="9269d197-cfa9-4f5d-965b-92fb37c33617"><mjx-msub data-ref="9bd3d865-7abe-48be-ab1d-84d984ffcf36"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="44252a8e-ae31-42e7-960f-c1af9179a676"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="8bfcf0be-77f0-4640-bcdf-dcb787b34246"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style="vertical-align: -0.15em;" data-ref="c1c068a9-270d-481b-bbc2-3cfb5b32a321" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-mn class="mjx-n" size="s" data-ref="aef6d908-5bad-4db7-ac2e-16c332288258"><mjx-c class="mjx-c31" data-ref="dea0a06a-20c3-4c42-84ca-db09311d621f"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="3977c14c-fddc-4f5c-9d5f-e1a492468715"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ad0f5419-5848-4b93-9610-4b193fb34a60"><msub data-ref="afa6d4a7-41a4-4a8e-a7cf-cbb9e63e0029"><mi data-ref="f6b4889a-ebea-4fc5-8a24-4503f63ba331">v</mi><mn data-ref="80f3a5