				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-from="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-to="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0"><div class="page" data-ref="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-from="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-to="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01"><div data-ref="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-split-to="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="991c7da8-bfd2-45be-a9fe-d3fa39d8cd6c" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="991c7da8-bfd2-45be-a9fe-d3fa39d8cd6c" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="f1711518-d5c3-44dd-b71c-b9e4760608e9"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="3c3f8119-fe65-47a6-a20c-438027c33751"><thead data-ref="91e67db9-381f-476f-acbb-79613be245f6"><tr data-ref="aca563ef-c913-4102-8d96-2c803f50e674"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="50c1058b-37b5-4079-99d2-46c6242d2728" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 7</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="af155dbc-0e3e-4d73-95bd-12fb20c8e6ab" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="8856fac7-8bfb-4621-ba19-99626e5a903d"><i data-ref="a5891830-11de-4410-a4b3-b62a872ed6f4">Depth-First Search (DFS)</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="67140d31-1935-4fe3-9b76-d37aaa4f4ad6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-09-05</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="c741473b-b405-4206-8ae3-9369bdb8dc5d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="91411836-c19d-483d-9952-3643bf27b09d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="0061bb1e-e069-4404-9d99-b161210b3c2f"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="346a0fb1-2893-4cf5-ae66-4a9e601c37ac"><p data-ref="c40fb2dd-2d3f-44eb-b27d-90c4f2b47f18" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to implement and perform a Depth-First Search (DFS) on a directed graph represented using an adjacency list. The program should print all the nodes reachable from a given starting node.</p><p data-ref="e1f1e327-0513-4e3a-b6b9-5ae9f3f64f4e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="5f0204e8-da25-4700-b579-0860404a5210"></p><p data-ref="877d4210-b708-45aa-854a-14983bc7d0b0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="c7c8727e-4d9a-45c8-a172-010b52cf26ae">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="13850ee4-b655-4adb-8c56-4d70fbcb226f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="c34eae73-a611-46a4-b973-d3c3891596b4">The first line contains two integers: <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="1ad549ef-c4bf-4e06-884b-d7236f10202e" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="929c65f3-e9f7-48f2-abd4-ddb17efcb4d1"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="96ba237e-1fd9-4830-9840-3551d97e06ab"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D449 TEX-I" data-ref="1279b534-2a65-433b-8f14-c302df6b48ef"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="79cc62c6-bf0d-421e-b937-5d1cb6915ad6"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="7141149e-a94d-4900-a34d-8c2db33c7b0e"><mi data-ref="0f1a49eb-0048-43aa-a3d1-b1393eb563e5">V</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> (number of vertices) and <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="01d979a3-f449-40fb-90fd-3e25a62822ba" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="ee15ea63-57fd-4fc1-9a91-0c005a1c0b9e"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="072316a6-d950-4715-adb4-84b585b65655"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="55c557a6-34ee-463f-a5e5-916d42488c27"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="cea4ace5-e932-4e3b-80c8-8e0d29c2f22e"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="98f81649-bbc2-46ea-9be0-8e6c1e4f8964"><mi data-ref="ba490efa-3741-47de-9adf-9b9f42610a7b">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> (number of edges).</li><li data-ref="6a8fb905-9bc6-459e-8813-578462a99c9a">The next <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b639b8f5-d2a0-47e6-9be5-5d7a012471ef" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="95f187a5-0456-46d2-a69b-fb55766ccfb3"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="050e5d15-c55c-4f28-a50b-7002b848f4c8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="6244af4e-9b5b-444a-81b3-767d3095c60c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="5840f015-2b3b-47e9-81c7-f43c05d39e01"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="fb7bb1d9-abb5-4429-b016-765895e7204d"><mi data-ref="c5134d6d-48ec-4a92-9064-03119d5836f0">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lines each contain two integers: <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="abbb2168-2695-4250-925d-e95a76cd343a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="1b214d25-3a14-4ec5-84fa-f7cdb30762a9"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="afa63016-34e4-4747-a584-7d0f0eeb537f"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D462 TEX-I" data-ref="a89124dc-1843-4970-948a-ead3408339d7"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="a3a496ff-8a54-4042-972d-049fcb0def3d"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="7a586649-c314-4f1f-9414-d56d7318ab0a"><mi data-ref="1c1df0c5-53e0-4836-954e-466a26e8b377">u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="8ce44848-6866-4bac-ab74-fa12e23e7ad6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="deb73180-e547-48d4-a509-68adf4fbd87c"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="1ee7c253-1dff-42b1-90cf-64c2a1e4f36c"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="8ac6379b-73fe-46c6-a7e3-d870487d5f94"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="f6d2c143-681b-419b-addb-6566add62488"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="82f727f4-58a7-46e4-9eed-638d3b5cc359"><mi data-ref="98e07953-b12c-4c33-b5d8-3f87517bc108">v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, where there is a directed edge from node <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="f8a0e081-43ba-4627-91ae-88916ce778ea" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="e79fd1ce-2092-4a90-97c3-2083990a7855"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="070bce26-8a71-4068-9167-b664d2d87008"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D462 TEX-I" data-ref="a8a190da-8f56-4e14-92f4-1034b1fbd136"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="2aff532f-2083-4690-8259-f0d026c436bf"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6155ccd4-1e75-4f70-9cf4-03addcf7166b"><mi data-ref="db9a017f-3095-4f79-b827-ba6d5ee419c8">u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to node <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="5c6b9f97-d3ed-4ade-bfef-c4e34fb999d8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="341ea661-ae3f-486b-9bc2-0ee5128bf115"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="7dc8f8bc-5c5b-452d-a771-e7587fe616ab"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="2bd56b0e-089b-42c3-9623-03d5095675bd"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="64759ce8-44fc-4272-96f7-0177f1f115ae"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="19fe5449-f5df-4ae0-a41f-e3f1dd799627"><mi data-ref="78de8504-e322-4c22-9788-e75e839d5467">v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>.</li><li data-ref="d4fc364d-de8c-4ef7-bf8e-6e7c8e1d5ef3">The last line contains the starting node for the DFS traversal.</li></ul><p data-ref="ad8fe556-d3ca-4c71-b7fe-7c5b831fc2c6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d1d4290d-793f-41b2-be1e-2722694b92d0"></p><p data-ref="4231aae3-7f1d-4e08-bd0d-32855a1c1647" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="3bc6fab6-4db8-47cb-99bf-8a07d66a7cf8">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="62810fc3-02c6-4705-9f5e-d2d6837c89c0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="5a935df9-0ddb-4066-9d68-a511eebf58bc">Print all reachable nodes from the starting node in the order they are visited by DFS as a single line of space-separated integers.</li></ul><p data-ref="258e4618-2726-4aa1-8b8b-a5b4c7ecb57b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e3d1d69b-0c07-4cd0-8987-d61dfe316fb8"></p><p data-ref="ccb863a8-ad0f-436c-97e5-3d98d48740b8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="fa8feda0-cd2b-4625-a2f1-eab659f33680">﻿Note: </strong></p><ul data-ref="bd741776-f50f-4b23-8839-125a85334926" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="00b87b87-90f6-45cb-ad04-ef0cbf73e1c1">In DFS, the smaller numbered node is visited first when there are multiple adjacent nodes, ensuring a consistent traversal order</li><li data-ref="792e9d85-356f-4c27-86c4-3d184f67613a">Refer to the visible test cases for a better understanding.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="55431b86-2209-4b57-8ad8-acd9d2611768" data-split-to="55431b86-2209-4b57-8ad8-acd9d2611768" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="c5413e24-6fe8-408d-a2ed-5a6d34af0a09"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="31dbd83b-2652-4bcb-b79c-a7817f4096aa" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
