				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-from="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-to="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0"><div class="page" data-ref="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-from="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-to="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01"><div data-ref="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-split-to="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="468caf51-b033-4558-b370-1b2fd7ffbef6" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="468caf51-b033-4558-b370-1b2fd7ffbef6" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="1eabac35-ad99-46c0-8493-767d8f9b5cee"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="884aed96-63bf-4e1d-be00-631618d5a83a"><thead data-ref="788210f5-9384-4596-a133-676d7b5cfc35"><tr data-ref="8ab3b88c-eaed-48f1-b9a8-4773e593075e"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="cf8e4b16-4d5c-4efa-ace5-8b8243ac933d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 8</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="58f1bda4-365d-44db-b28c-e0bbebc70620" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="6ed20ef8-286b-46d8-a72e-2e93445b6db2"><i data-ref="b0a4bc5d-c002-4146-a14a-e26404b03f81"> Breadth First Search (BFS)</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="4bdcd24e-9c50-473c-8a57-67c33ac3c0b5" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-09-26</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="160efd1a-8112-49ea-bcd4-60fb77a4db41" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="f3e83909-ee13-4d67-987a-a4f657eb2055" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="6e2f90fb-9852-47f0-9e2e-2ecbfc6a9b95"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="0cd35f1e-6a58-44d7-81c2-06e0615717c5"><p data-ref="e00295ba-a07d-4bcd-b788-22da1a0e7f0b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to perform BFS on a directed graph using adjacency lists. The graph has <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b4750a4b-2b99-41d5-9f02-58e9b37c70a6" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="01ec5419-ba40-46f5-ae8e-ead142fbd634"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="983455c5-2401-444e-9082-65f1c98df4a2"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D449 TEX-I" data-ref="121f02ba-9676-4b0b-be0c-1881b2cc6c46"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="7ee5d04b-cd23-42f0-963a-8264970bf5c3"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="c27d7f77-0d5f-4ec4-bf85-5aba7bd6f935"><mi data-ref="eb68ce86-8ed2-4dc8-b055-6322fb2271de">V</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> vertices and <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="dd74588c-dacd-46c8-95ee-4543ca23e06b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="c30de64c-cd4b-4d95-aabd-03e95d9081b0"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="17a65789-abb8-43f6-9c99-340a17261bb7"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="eb86c4b7-17dc-4fd9-8ed8-c48877772739"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="1dcb4e43-6dec-4451-9006-9be8d595af06"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ab1b5652-dc7f-4a5b-a589-e38075af93e5"><mi data-ref="ca2eefea-4e00-498b-827a-cdb227c898ee">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> edges. After building the graph, sort each vertex’s adjacency list in ascending order. Then perform BFS from a given starting node and print all reachable nodes in the order they are visited as space-separated integers. When multiple adjacent nodes are available, always visit the smallest one first.</p><p data-ref="c76bb7a6-f300-4573-964f-0c472cd91c60" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="73c683a5-b1ac-4312-8700-bc0e18ba396f"></p><p data-ref="17376296-2077-4568-9680-535b11fd4f6b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="0875928c-5896-4e53-b2cf-f8a597b8276b">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="f0898a06-72b2-41c6-b249-7a7773651e66" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="7b06928b-18c6-4cec-918c-ab276fc93460">The input begins with a line containing two integers <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="f3245106-d09b-4954-be81-c0382f73ef97" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="5c0fdc22-f73b-47c8-8b84-746b4f763e93"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="50693232-d061-46ce-8040-e95aabe61fb7"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D449 TEX-I" data-ref="895a1d9c-ee2c-4a51-8e5b-45808ef252b0"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="93d6e6c7-1631-4601-ad2d-af8812f89eae"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="faf15d4f-509b-403b-9e00-2fddcadd6031"><mi data-ref="8a3deae2-4bca-4898-9c9b-6f0f6fffefd8">V</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="af297ad4-1ac7-451a-a93b-956e689bf1c7" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="f0891787-db5e-45e6-9aa8-7b56fce07493"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="dc7e3d66-103b-4824-ab70-cc5ae2cf16d3"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="b99c3365-1716-41a8-b6d1-655e34a28ed3"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="72502b55-0e0a-4403-b44c-096ea7df178e"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="9dc4b57a-725a-448a-b2dd-c8b66ef476f9"><mi data-ref="84428d6d-9d54-4709-8ff9-7902b2f944e0">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, where <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="35351b91-17d2-4a88-97a7-76297824ebba" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="894311f8-f832-4728-8708-ab49b6a720fd"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="196884ae-a572-40e0-bb9a-6acea2235300"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D449 TEX-I" data-ref="04192b75-1548-43e7-b4f0-35eea329ae21"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="7083b9a5-47d2-400e-a01c-f24ec79854b1"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="976360ab-f766-4a4e-9225-926dc1181445"><mi data-ref="a9234e93-12fe-4f19-804b-2202cb3930ee">V</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the number of vertices and <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="c72499c6-98df-4ffa-9376-a6604c3ee691" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="3b8a3f3c-e3aa-4feb-a066-e24cebca4eb7"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="4a829dd2-bbf6-4a69-b884-83059940bdcc"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="c1717747-d89d-452c-a254-33201864fe7e"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="ce6e8e39-18a1-47f1-945f-c965c2cacde7"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ccf0c353-0fcd-444d-b13c-f8c9c79798f7"><mi data-ref="4e404f21-f1f7-49d9-9380-a96b57bc7211">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the number of edges in the directed graph.</li><li data-ref="85ea1072-3322-4b74-9c98-0efe898756ec">The following <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b9608bcd-ecfc-4fe1-8f9f-37d93b109c15" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="d30efb7a-90cb-40b2-880f-9fabb2b8b759"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="d83469b1-cbb3-4120-806d-d7e76c076db1"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D438 TEX-I" data-ref="860fd693-4bf1-4112-bfbb-3e410bf0493c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="06b5862a-0015-4886-8da8-2721d0b10067"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="b334eb8f-3ed5-4ef4-86ec-28db1a876174"><mi data-ref="c908d855-37fc-4c53-8d4c-e2848213bade">E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lines each contain two integers <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="f0f759a6-5a95-42af-b6a9-9d8311e6906f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="f22986e6-1a65-4ead-b925-68d2edae9ac8"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="482d47c2-7d88-4d67-babe-1954d4a1a1a3"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D462 TEX-I" data-ref="5414f1ba-d1a2-4283-8853-b7f3f4b3060a"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="42515cb6-b3a6-488d-bfed-d11ff219f322"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="f5498392-e98b-44ce-84fa-51327fe3cf7d"><mi data-ref="212801ac-49a6-46c9-8148-4fb71b9c1ff1">u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="feabd7d1-8adc-4482-9dd7-fed014dff281" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="e5b8d072-a94c-4c29-8ecc-fade0b70d76d"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="cf39b630-100f-4054-930a-5d12208e2cbb"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="3022f0f6-896c-42de-8173-efce719a3f3c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="f64994b4-5288-4f01-9916-a58d28b5cd20"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6130d1ac-ccf5-4cba-8346-7aa13fb2f1a4"><mi data-ref="e9907273-f358-41f3-b090-7c63dbc32ad1">v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, indicating a directed edge from vertex <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="8540da89-f773-4582-b784-b5452a922212" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="0e75384b-ab21-4ff6-990b-af363f44f56a"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="ae315c83-58ba-44db-818c-2f3009e977af"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D462 TEX-I" data-ref="f3947344-0e49-41a4-835e-fbb663347699"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="a5c300d2-3f1b-4898-85ff-799f3fd81faf"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6d8c15ec-530f-4059-a988-f97dcf125f77"><mi data-ref="e470e647-58a6-4dc3-8ccd-7b9785612874">u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to vertex <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b473d7df-bb15-4e24-8c30-353eb3d2be92" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="5a8c5fc3-7d43-45ca-989c-7c8e8afd754d"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="8ca5c24e-f84b-4fcc-98c9-5c746320419e"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="93a8edf3-068a-4090-81f6-e7e65dc0b717"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="7be0a404-9a6a-4da4-8305-730a0517dd6b"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="08268757-c411-4042-a388-49a8ecfe98d9"><mi data-ref="4fbf30c0-4d69-4510-8c7b-3c71ad72984a">v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>.</li><li data-ref="7421324e-f1ff-43e0-8f15-d57d6dbb67b5">The final line contains a single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="1a303aa4-2416-445d-9958-ea60a5a32193" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="9ff6d418-9a62-416d-9b39-ef1571884e8c"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="04ec1b3b-642a-46e5-ad37-29d7a31c38b7"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D460 TEX-I" data-ref="ba908b1f-ffe8-4cdf-a57e-c5e2f20c1ce0"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="c4a46749-dcfe-44f4-b81c-d8155a27a6c8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D461 TEX-I" data-ref="3435d0b3-381a-43e8-b942-457ec310865b"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="10ba8278-60bc-466b-990e-52921c65d9f0"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44E TEX-I" data-ref="d4e0257b-8846-49de-8494-617f48e9c997"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="1285ac31-b16c-4b2f-b8c7-5ba3c245cf03"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45F TEX-I" data-ref="d7eef920-0f9b-4f9d-8cdd-c4bca073be2c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="81f52186-0600-4974-96ce-9a62b3b2441d"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D461 TEX-I" data-ref="3c47b297-5630-4396-a941-7a02c352cc59"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="5c78fb22-fca0-4a8e-8b91-21077b1b5cee"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="fc1185da-a9cc-43cf-bfea-336362620cb3"><mi data-ref="593b7530-9d35-40fe-9438-aa219b9be7e4">s</mi><mi data-ref="cc5d2edf-9ed4-4c88-babf-e3987db4dc35">t</mi><mi data-ref="f4099efc-65ae-4c23-a0af-a65e8976a192">a</mi><mi data-ref="e9846ebf-b1f2-4c94-a6ee-afbf9a0d1ed9">r</mi><mi data-ref="8b02939b-6471-4833-af59-64793ee13c1a">t</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, which represents the starting vertex for the BFS traversal.</li></ul><p data-ref="393279e1-7dc7-4413-affd-82e8bee213b6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="0f3570aa-2dac-46c9-92c3-fb589fa2f26b"></p><p data-ref="37c5af55-bcc1-4489-87fa-9d6389e8e1fb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="b55220e9-d96e-4c14-b72e-bb072d0378a4">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="3d6acc63-74a0-4a33-925e-71af1bdffe1d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="c5923e5c-c035-43a5-a3af-7b98c26e638c">Print all reachable nodes from the starting vertex in the order they are visited by BFS, as a single line of space-separated integers.</li></ul><p data-ref="539599d9-0ec0-439c-ac72-bbc26a172d2b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b7e07986-eb82-4a44-b820-650001dddc04"></p><p data-ref="c1bfa65e-9120-43d6-852d-7c28b5a81ef9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="1360590e-7282-4f28-999f-f1edc8194bc0">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="d5ab0db8-2708-4596-a903-2705e59136d6" data-split-to="d5ab0db8-2708-4596-a903-2705e59136d6" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="ba3c1ffd-ab89-488b-8858-637d6f617d5f"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="d15ed45d-0702-407d-a5ce-0484289b4e47" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
