x solid black;" data-ref="93ec7aa5-de05-4f83-9e3c-0bc0d522d6e0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="6b33fe53-c723-4b45-a3d3-311e37010dbf"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="9d22dcb3-2a3f-495d-be6e-f672352ff968"><p data-ref="6ab06048-8e1c-4094-9198-e6095ebd4745" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program for finding the count of bi-connected components in a given graph</p><p data-ref="3e5194db-20af-4f68-a7e8-4c28b9c4862c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="a6f30dcc-73b3-4203-87c6-570b006e48ab"></p><p data-ref="ab31f1d7-277a-453b-8c54-cfbb496aacfb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="3d530ffc-6652-464c-928b-6839a23bbff2">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="e92f972b-721e-45cf-9436-56f34b31ca72" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="e3dd46b7-ed13-45fa-a4e1-ca2cc94bf79d">First line in the input indicates the number of vertices.</li><li data-ref="23b53055-eb5b-4821-907a-a6bdf035b50c">Second line in the input indicates the number of edges.</li><li data-ref="ab19cc79-23ee-4a42-b3ea-efe5dc94dcb9">The next following lines indicates the edges, which takes two vertices <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="1e92e463-f6a5-4c84-b199-ca487d892878" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="838de9e9-656c-4f90-9e76-39586cabf87b"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="2218831b-51eb-4124-8a81-f6c581d23b89"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D462 TEX-I" data-ref="9140fcdd-db66-43df-8fc3-982441ae851a"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="ac99b5a7-31b8-4c25-89bf-9b5d93837d80"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6a2dc199-0fec-40db-a777-285400af4e01"><mi data-ref="b004a340-255a-4cc4-88a7-fa4c972d18ca">u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="dbcedf90-103f-4160-ab34-d8f6de915a75" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="661b6f0b-6323-48f5-9b8b-413431a97b68"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="b127e242-3f67-48cf-b24a-4531e53abfaa"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="9dcd34ef-0bcd-4907-9026-7f315b6220e4"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="7564f920-7048-4af4-9269-ff6717b7f94c"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="2cc5205b-f227-48de-8f94-371951bfaac2"><mi data-ref="de1e4f80-4123-4109-b308-49094a1bf86c">v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as space separated integers for each edge.</li></ul><p data-ref="befa0ea1-1a6f-4543-80e6-abea5270b84e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="67f65935-50fe-4ff0-b1f6-fc8b236e742c"></p><p data-ref="6d761c22-7e8d-445b-9719-8262a59ed33e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="4b6554c0-d9fa-4752-b680-34ddf785cdd8">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="d5e866be-74ef-4c7a-a7bf-b6772c85df0a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="91642b42-4656-455b-9770-ee164df72fee">The code will print the number of biconnected components found in the graph.</li></ul><p data-ref="79e0c43e-882d-4687-8993-d20d7ad7a3eb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="57b5d3cf-0e68-4313-b692-6bcf8ad567af"></p><p data-ref="caec43e3-b0df-430e-8d51-4ec18ed91fa1" data-counter-list-1-reset