bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="39e63836-7d08-4d64-8467-cce80e42ff67" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="1620f21b-d3e8-4db5-b20c-bce4d2393250"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="1ef252b4-0024-41f0-90b5-32d3e7c5cd22"><p data-ref="70d7be80-9333-4611-8ae3-9c86cf4ac255" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program that implements the quick sort to sort a given list of integers in ascending order.</p><p data-ref="2df3e9d2-38bb-45f9-9bdb-05dcdc1a0909" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="cfae6ff6-61bf-4e1f-9e8a-d5a8b0692d1e"></p><p data-ref="3977f6b1-9845-4b2a-8b91-e8b5f8258f25" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="6bfe3e18-a473-4f9c-bd77-0f035bf79f52">Input Format</strong></p><ul data-ref="d0efb930-c958-4076-bd10-599ee24665d5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="4f7e5878-896d-46dc-adee-7fa4b3674d8a">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="14a6071a-b6bb-4913-b9a3-3535ff5720d5" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="84ec0656-3d4c-4724-bc12-f7f6a6f0b852"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="52d462d1-1f1b-4aaf-a304-20cc45e34744"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="35ded9cc-af0a-4f0e-8402-93d8a3014edf"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="f9107b49-034d-4cf0-addd-c1a979a1ae65"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="dc8db1e8-3260-44a7-b1d1-1975ba6c062c"><mi data-ref="b3cda4ff-496a-45a8-aa43-811d3ff58b1d">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> which represents the number of elements in the array.</li><li data-ref="210a9dc6-e528-49b5-a898-da5d2ae6492e">The second line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="6578e872-bf05-4543-8108-3c8de6e567df" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="af6fb58f-f402-420b-9971-05a64b9a86ef"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="e6e97c7e-2d89-4764-a4fc-cbbe69cb300a"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="cb14d310-e70e-4206-9129-9eaf7262264e"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="d590b17f-b717-453d-a128-848294b6997d"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="fd0f1919-2cdb-4f17-aaf6-c9709c646f82"><mi data-ref="04af886a-3164-42fb-92a0-baca107d9736">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers, which are the elements of the array.</li></ul><p data-ref="7b33aa0f-78b1-48cc-bfb4-9085dd9d54b0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 lis