bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="35957c9c-8386-4d5a-8386-c58ede88dcf9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="ad0d523e-e9ec-4a3b-a27d-2b298cdb5316"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="cd89dcfe-a3b1-43ee-b474-8c9708775a2e"><p data-ref="8cfc6a46-adfe-490f-adb2-79fdbb3687f1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to implement the Merge Sort algorithm to sort an array of integers in ascending order.</p><p data-ref="931f9988-489b-48f2-9865-5071a07c1ac2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="46d71cc9-599a-48f0-8f8c-2651af6eae18"></p><p data-ref="46380e2e-a71d-4629-8be6-ec5cdd884508" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="a800cfa2-39e7-4959-ac99-e620d4a03473">Input Format</strong></p><ul data-ref="21f2e0ad-499f-4c3b-b03d-eb1c887028d8" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data