069dcc0a4825">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers, representing the array elements in ascending order after sorting.</li></ul><p data-ref="c2474f26-bbf6-4759-bf1c-2a51c616a791" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="961e7d4b-eca1-4f88-a927-b61cc42dbef8"></p><p data-ref="f51cfb22-8a0b-4b2c-ab63-03512e2d4258" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="df30dc1b-a95e-44f2-826a-e5c87cedd00a"></p><p data-ref="a6540f57-d307-485b-a3ec-6924a75aec86" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="00d30d8f-c63b-4f6d-a736-63dec25aeec8">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="cc37e1d2-bebe-42a7-a713-870075a96579" data-split-to="cc37e1d2-bebe-42a7-a713-870075a96579" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="2393a358-ce4b-463d-be1e-eac854faa9b7"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="2aec7997-1656-4b2c-be05-7255e317a8