x-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="c93d9ce0-2fb0-48ba-a1a4-da0adb6267e8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D463 TEX-I" data-ref="1e03cf60-c557-4b69-a936-38a7ed8e326a"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="81e3b0d8-96be-4cad-a556-1e4f73dac459"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="e6e89505-b550-40fb-bd33-518d4d22fdb7"><mi data-ref="85ae05ea-9deb-4664-a140-6dabda51b139">v</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> with weight <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b5de8abd-0e8d-4f8a-88c8-640363af84d2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="322ed694-948f-41e3-a663-519a4fc4a9dd"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="1c84f08e-e3a5-4f3a-91fd-0f119b52b5b6"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D464 TEX-I" data-ref="434fd424-4d7b-4cf8-a810-7d91492d3d74"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="0a0a1baa-e897-413c-88f9-1437442f0b69"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="25fca689-d326-4b7c-be9e-b4f62e08d720"><mi data-ref="94ed380c-f5ee-4113-b9c8-98fd1f2a1483">w</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>.</li><li data-ref="978409c0-5549-41e7-aa9b-a45e961091b7">The last line contains a single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="dfcd80ec-ea9b-4261-8e73-d719cd9d56ec" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="1408f1c0-fe04-4b35-97cc-e57a52f5ea75"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="46dd3d49-4300-4edd-91ec-5f8d0cd460e7"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D460 TEX-I" data-ref="a90fbc0f-d68c-4087-99fe-835c2d868610"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="64d3872a-e467-440a-91ac-3ec4118686db"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45F TEX-I" data-ref="b408b866-2452-42c9-97d1-35c418e8c28d"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="af1fb452-8f53-4de1-9ca9-eb45d3998c9b"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D450 TEX-I" data-ref="3eeba9fe-5418-4c82-bb8c-d505231ae1c8"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="8c7f45d4-7947-49cf-be97-c05fed26af7b"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="1afdaade-a602-4e54-9a38-18abcd07a35c"><mi data-ref="69b4ed02-82d3-4fe4-b8d2-d17be3e5877f">s</mi><mi data-ref="b95524ad-3da4-4161-992c-83d9d8027715">r</mi><mi data-ref="75dea1f9-709a-460b-888a-4cc07a921963">c</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the source vertex from which shortest distances are to be calculated.</li></ul><p data-ref="2a1d018b-fa3c-4729-a44e-14c82c9e6621" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="251c3478-52ea-4b98-ab72-36c95fb40127"></p><p data-ref="45ac1a38-c71e-4776-ab6b-d82693bfb464" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="8b0fddb9-1d16-45d5-b174-1a84e27f2bec">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="0388e611-d434-4115-8072-fac6d1606aad" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="dcc7160c-bf7c-494d-bf35-30d6c5a1b4aa">The output consists of <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="4ab4bb17-046b-4fb2-bf77-668f51cb0aaa" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="b75e77ef-a5ed-476c-8955-404f9655f8e1"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="d76aa908-2226-45ca-bb7b-6bd0b11af7be"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D449 TEX-I" data-ref="908455b7-de28-4fff-a78d-c34b6ba10544"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="84d66622-cdcc-4324-ab9a-ad73a61e947e"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="4e05ffd6-c7a3-4ec6-acf2-14785d813f61"><mi data-ref="c13bd652-fb79-4313-b28d-ae5fdb2e7384">V</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lines.</li><li data-ref="4528c06f-d939-4c74-bf7a-7f06ece898b4">Each line contains two integers:</li><li class="ql-indent-1" data-ref="7616509b-fad1-43f1-8371-54555173fe48">The vertex number and the minimum distance from the source vertex to that vertex, space separated</li></ul><p data-ref="1eff3382-d4dd-45fc-8533-3570b326d48f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="359db266-a75e-48f4-9ed3-8f9025b029ce"></p><p data-ref="1e0717b1-4b06-4a8f-b9b8-e575500b77c2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="edc11cfe-11e0-407c-9751-2e466329c34b">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="c52c126b-1c77-40bd-8bb6-b17454cc579a" data-split-to="c52c126b-1c77-40bd-8bb6-b17454cc579a" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="5b40b4ec-b5e6-42ce-848a-450a3a3d8326"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="0487a6f3-b814-41e2-97f4-9ad69ff2dfe0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
