35-8618-d1b69a4e8a23" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="1aa2d7cd-8b07-457d-b7e9-6e99d679d921">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="5875a84a-374f-45db-82fe-0a11ca9375af" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="3ac4097c-d328-4fe8-b402-9df53a6d1dd2">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="209cd3ed-1dd1-4d12-adc2-7ea455a6ce22" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="4f4ac597-f130-460d-a56b-5b53da4b6f36"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="9c485e6e-8089-4893-b2ca-747571149456"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="56640494-b2ac-4bd6-affd-620778b0668b"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="ef9b4803-9af1-4d23-9a05-5925085b3330"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="5a0bb8be-7643-4864-ad0e-7d31082d0cac"><mi data-ref="938ea718-5217-4f23-b2e5-6e9bc155714d">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> representing the number of jobs.</li><li data-ref="a728e3e2-9092-4b02-b8ee-64ffc4d6a7e9">The next <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="43f6168c-9bd3-4826-a5e5-7e38994de650" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="3f4118d4-0e86-460b-96ea-82d083aa5269"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="5378f5ff-a2aa-471d-b317-4b24339efb27"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="1022f2e8-e71a-45c4-8c68-01e76ecfb9ab"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="50cc5587-9316-4986-b6cb-96415e9b08b2"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="5ca4f952-f1dd-40d3-80af-229c7f774e69"><mi data-ref="19e2232a-ef63-4e06-a41f-20afb6c4f7d1">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lines each contain three space-separated integers: {Job ID, Job Deadline, Job Profit} — representing one job per line.</li></ul><p data-ref="6e86afe5-2457-49a6-9235-cd15fafd70ad" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="66b047de-01f4-4098-8861-c22918315422"></p><p data-ref="dcc90bff-f143-4c73-bcc5-85fd76864390" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="ee961ba1-878c-4ebf-b0dd-f9cbe0ac8749">Output Format</strong></p><ul data-ref="546d784a-90f5-4cb3-9f6e-09d76772d024" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="8cf5282f-3297-453c-9324-be0c38d546b6">Two integers separated by a space:</li><li data-ref="d0da0b30-dfd0-45c0-a26a-946da671860c">The first integer represents the number of jobs done.The second integer represents the maximum profit obtained.</li></ul><p data-ref="118acf80-495c-4087-bd1e-8d6fe4672fac" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="270fc882-5e1c-4be4-b542-446575e3f14c"></p><p data-ref="db3c12bc-d520-476a-b9ba-df9738b18f95" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong style="color: var(--text-color); background-color: var(--background);" data-ref="fbf711b2-eeaf-4c5b-9849-b092d34e2442" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Constraints:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a598d8fe-da0d-4350-97a1-8be1a4a0511d" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="484f6459-ce60-41a4-8cda-7ff0cbfbae16"><mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="cb37ad90-bf81-4e3f-b311-0c1a8cc2071b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" da