				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-from="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-to="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0"><div class="page" data-ref="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-from="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-to="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01"><div data-ref="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-split-to="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="58c66fa8-4d71-4d29-b217-0483693c5fde" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="58c66fa8-4d71-4d29-b217-0483693c5fde" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="a36e1886-4662-4361-9f50-9d5e393357e7"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="c3330d73-5c98-4168-a487-d8bc1c5253e8"><thead data-ref="f937c253-c89a-4350-8560-03a8e8ba63ca"><tr data-ref="d232aaee-7808-4fae-bc06-5393cd5426ee"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="d0647767-ec76-4b06-8d26-a3cbf63eab68" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 14</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="ea4d6fc0-aa7c-46a5-9f4f-b72eab7056f0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="4f0db291-2d11-46a0-b29e-598efda08a29"><i data-ref="46433123-dc8f-4c1d-b549-48fcf8f4617e">Program to implement Knapsack problem Using Dynamic Programming</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="c9eff032-c3ea-4bc5-adb0-e648304d1834" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-10-31</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="1b2a1ea0-8014-4591-9413-33985d58c8d9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="6cc66f3d-194d-45cb-a1d6-1bda91faddda" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="9fc097c8-ca80-40ff-a962-4744921e26b7"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="dadc3b94-469b-40f7-ad03-60d9a49b3922"><p data-ref="0830a194-0300-4735-8d05-7ef1281e53d0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">You are given <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="e77a72dc-a308-4281-bf0e-f8be57d5c9e2" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="8a23559c-0a28-46d5-8ac9-dbf129da4d80"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="2ef0ed4d-3e31-4a07-85d1-2108a3e194fb"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="1a53298a-37cf-49d8-8cc9-1517c54f8f4e"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="85f9a162-97f7-49ed-a0ac-3cc7585f6fcd"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ddd7e3d4-73cb-4b23-a607-d65a93b6397c"><mi data-ref="a677b17d-19e3-42ba-8730-f506e3d38b29">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> items, each with a specific weight and value. You have a knapsack with a maximum capacity <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="dd3a0a12-28b4-4cc3-8ac5-6fde5054af20" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="678ac509-0481-4580-83a4-4292c74ff38c"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="33b111b2-ae25-4900-bb4f-f6d0d7f3c5f8"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44A TEX-I" data-ref="0bef3525-818e-409b-89fa-c4de1328fe23"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="f83d28d3-de12-421d-a2e5-f4359000f2a0"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="3e283bd8-48a8-44f4-8960-53ac87175aff"><mi data-ref="2c63ca5d-bf3f-4acf-bd40-25772528d3d3">W</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>. Your goal is to select a subset of these items such that the total weight is less than or equal to <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="a9d7eec3-f2c9-4f69-ae6a-b9a6bfe9ce30" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="94f9276c-2815-482b-928b-9f0851040f2b"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="477bf9a6-8e29-4687-b356-7e31c391c246"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44A TEX-I" data-ref="b952eb19-0056-483e-8532-7b27aa34688d"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="36f54591-f482-4d72-8983-4650aab78176"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="424d4a94-0528-4450-b171-2366c3d000e5"><mi data-ref="3cf6b45b-dfdc-47ef-965f-8eb6425ec68e">W</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, and the total value is as large as possible.</p><p data-ref="1ed24c8c-5855-4832-821b-f1c964ba83fc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="a536ba21-2c2a-4ca4-b304-28861c0ffdb0"></p><p data-ref="9ba78e60-b83f-4040-8d5d-92aa3dca86d7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">This is the classic 0/1 Knapsack problem, where each item can either be included once or excluded from the knapsack.</p><p data-ref="382558f6-4557-4229-a268-77f0d7ce99e3" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d1e311b3-caa6-43eb-b73c-5e82b116528c"></p><p data-ref="013062e0-074a-450d-9cc8-dfd03c9ef62e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="8586d906-420c-4813-8e61-3629e8d4c646">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="cd956a26-3dac-47ae-8925-3bdb56a8ca34" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="af2cdf72-5429-4436-a567-a80f5e4c3aff">The first line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="467e3e45-73b2-46af-af05-f083ac9bc1d1" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="29ae0b72-a937-4fb1-9a70-47a588b93424"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="7eeef241-3582-4fe5-a69d-8588a618f6a0"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="3d32ece8-b5a0-43b0-820e-a5e3a4e45d3c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="e597581f-64bb-4874-9765-2f31f09fc022"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="3baf75f4-6a89-4d5c-8a2f-71f103b06527"><mi data-ref="999b993c-1d57-48f6-bee9-1002c5b5c0ea">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of items to consider for the knapsack.</li><li data-ref="09436fe7-5617-4ba8-874b-bb3fa573be16">The second line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="893aa6da-116e-4c7b-8d0b-a09e6b3aab41" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="b582e921-47f2-4432-867e-b58ffa862f8a"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="d1ce6bae-f951-4117-a71b-311b306ea884"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="2b591d47-2439-485d-b084-ea7779bc5f30"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="f2dcc637-fea5-40af-afbb-c8d7f64dd6c0"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="464d0e6c-2643-4e3d-a15e-062098fb4836"><mi data-ref="018dbbf1-9586-4b64-8b84-f0bf925a060e">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers, representing the weights of the items.</li><li data-ref="6891d710-47bc-4cb4-a5bf-197e63b1b801">The third line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="8c766f1c-ef4c-4e96-a63a-1f3a06a7e03d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="f2b64357-838e-4792-a440-ed08164d9370"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="14a322f1-eb79-4159-8375-51a1b45e92b9"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="1ddd93f5-0dc8-4c17-9bef-252464f4e440"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="070988ba-d032-47e1-99a1-136237eb89c8"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="d9d7ee85-74dc-4b6e-ad97-c8dd2227bacf"><mi data-ref="27112794-b5b6-414a-94be-73211003362b">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers, representing the values of the items, corresponding to their weights.</li><li data-ref="22b46025-2d33-4109-af8e-b78179633493">The fourth line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="f68c818b-d513-4734-a75e-97dcca5e03cc" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="de8cd608-c890-45be-8385-38f28c1b2cf7"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="6e55a0f5-683d-471f-8fc7-5889b8ade83a"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D44A TEX-I" data-ref="b182a189-46ef-494d-b5d4-7fcfe90e7c6c"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="ff641f08-f440-4422-953b-26e5c335923a"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="52b8c3c8-8d3c-4343-9cc0-5b1e2dd1f118"><mi data-ref="a54a2b8d-e93e-40be-8f7c-d657c1ae418a">W</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the capacity of the knapsack.</li></ul><p data-ref="f4384e68-1b0d-45a3-a8d9-646e69008059" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d5dd466d-d5f0-45b5-8444-155d90d16313"></p><p data-ref="57cf127c-8ca4-4b27-b305-cb945dcabf5b" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="04e654e4-aff2-48e1-8bbd-7f54096cee89">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="3db3225f-8543-42df-af0a-c885904013a9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="b048fa24-9187-41d8-9ca8-959f0b161b7c">Print the maximum profit that can be obtained by selecting items such that their combined weight does not exceed the knapsack capacity.</li></ul><p data-ref="3dd81d18-a5ae-4d05-a80c-3a0bb8b73086" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="cd288bac-5a76-48aa-a35f-d739e30e784f"></p><p data-ref="60ab2bc5-47c4-4759-9965-c5c4fac64c8a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="08f7eb9e-df75-494c-b29a-cd0d99551e41">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p><p data-ref="3bcf5921-8b91-4f6a-8533-c6bf0cd7e0c2" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="3403daa7-bfdd-4f69-a1b6-557c23bfc2c5"></p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="8afed5d4-6e48-409f-bcb7-2a8c90cabb8f" data-split-to="8afed5d4-6e48-409f-bcb7-2a8c90cabb8f" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="e41a42c8-a645-4364-8c3c-49d66bfb50e9"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="4062bb31-5220-4560-8e3b-09604219f943" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
