				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-from="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-to="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0"><div class="page" data-ref="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-from="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-to="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01"><div data-ref="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-split-to="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="4e6a05c5-824a-4e2b-bfeb-3ca5c2eecd61" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="4e6a05c5-824a-4e2b-bfeb-3ca5c2eecd61" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="6ae179e4-4e4f-4bc0-ae2c-bcaf1f3b2c9b"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="2c6b3843-966b-4312-bb55-574be83ce1e3"><thead data-ref="7ead90da-e1f1-4851-af30-ec6bea576528"><tr data-ref="b5b64413-c3db-4c10-866a-b26805eb75ff"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="546c6db6-a46e-4b36-b052-c6550deda327" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 15</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="471712a7-9298-4ab1-8f3c-82dfb0656b44" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="6fcbba00-7052-4b92-b779-2accbe2ed926"><i data-ref="d6605914-aae5-45a2-a000-1906b2742abe">N-Queens Problem</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="a5f3a060-19cf-4236-bf6f-ddc024c3bc85" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-10-31</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="c1896b6e-df58-488e-8839-69d4b15aedb0" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="8017fe16-f608-43a5-8d49-6f9b0a6e4021" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="e33a0ec3-209c-44af-9e9f-7e2d2f3c5e74"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="7856a114-49d0-4416-95b0-99add85a1681"><p data-ref="9d2279f7-0a05-4ddf-a0fb-f89714acdfd9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a C program to solve the N-Queens problem using backtracking. The goal is to place <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="3074ae39-0895-4893-9a32-a1756283f76b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="53be416f-5763-4665-9b7b-44d052344b68"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="850fd5f4-1bc9-4138-b9c4-015489dd82f1"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="95d4e58b-5907-45e5-889a-9a4e18548e10"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="be575424-15f1-400f-a3cc-97d324258e42"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="94f920b9-9fa2-4e51-a1f1-d654d3305a09"><mi data-ref="ed23338d-b3a9-4998-a315-7636c0aa86f6">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> queens on an <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="ecd22f3a-9004-4e1f-ba34-bfdc0feded67" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="8445d2ac-6b61-499f-93ad-75a1f8c7233f"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="b359db9e-c242-4386-a923-9f3c1234c960"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="d0b39db0-bde8-4cb4-94e8-0f79114dc308"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class="mjx-n" space="3" data-ref="b91eb158-fd3b-434c-8daa-3af9365ae300"><mjx-c class="mjx-cD7" data-ref="8628a8b0-180c-404d-b487-8b6625d1b210"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" space="3" data-ref="bd4b08a3-fe1d-4888-b332-9edc8c755d9c"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="c09e3224-18a0-4586-86a5-db8363881951"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="720cf6ec-5f7d-4f51-b12f-f93fdafe8a22"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="e65eb4f9-14d3-4b33-9ce9-5845373c7047"><mi data-ref="74a5fdac-f632-4771-822e-68286691cf84">N</mi><mo data-ref="9d829ac5-8c38-4192-bed3-80f2c2e2da4c">×</mo><mi data-ref="b46b8162-c072-4dea-92a2-d03c07dda36d">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> chessboard such that no two queens attack each other. A queen can attack another queen if they share the same row, column, or diagonal. Your program should print the first valid configuration of the board found by placing queens from left to right and top to bottom, using a backtracking approach. The board must be displayed as an <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="da00fd2a-c571-497f-a6fc-b13b68f8597f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="1b307b36-f017-464a-924f-88fbd220b6ef"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="badf0402-d2f2-472b-96ed-a0e247f67358"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="729b9258-53c7-44c3-a871-00b5e2974ab6"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class="mjx-n" space="3" data-ref="8aa1a10d-e145-4fcc-bb5b-b1a139a2c199"><mjx-c class="mjx-cD7" data-ref="4a3bb2ce-0010-4a4b-b757-49b52f0ba16a"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" space="3" data-ref="eebe82be-6939-4efa-8615-53d5dce14f07"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="55051e71-d91c-4fdd-8f3b-4ae11cc0c15f"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="bc9341e8-2b3a-45a3-bc3b-5f829a8c03f0"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="5adfa098-55e5-4f4d-8025-13b4d39342fa"><mi data-ref="1086d74e-8e69-4c46-a572-d417de9425d9">N</mi><mo data-ref="3a2d5853-4dfc-4beb-acdf-39becb1cd27a">×</mo><mi data-ref="004ddeb7-a54a-4685-aaf0-c6b797f9dcf0">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> matrix where a cell contains 1 if a queen is placed there, and 0 otherwise. If no solution exists for the given value of <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="59307775-7b70-4970-b27e-63107a31b22f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="89ec820f-6380-4721-9668-67f916ac7d98"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="c4ae7d21-e4b0-4a0d-ba2c-e1b5d1780368"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="d7f65377-c238-4b7b-9192-c6b456713556"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="0af1f577-4efe-425d-b3fe-a6a25109f7c5"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="4b1ed5a3-a54b-4f45-b46e-a2d89e904fe5"><mi data-ref="91a500a9-6795-4344-b36e-0f7a1453635d">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, print a message indicating that no solution exists.</p><p data-ref="eeca7e45-fc00-41e0-8000-baeaffbfca30" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="7d26cc0d-f8e2-4d38-8357-8ac4782746db"></p><p data-ref="9ac16ac1-9766-4182-9666-e482be7a2c9c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="53987cde-5057-415b-893f-8def059a01df">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="3c36a0d9-8e0f-4e4a-9891-53bd6aae8969" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="a65c511e-3b37-4e81-ac65-f91f3a4c9ed4">A single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="c5f49930-cd40-42ad-aad0-ac7d6517eb2f" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="27dd73a1-c16b-47f2-a255-6e0b71c26d39"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="6a9cc1dd-5311-465a-b0ac-ba7d15b24589"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="59283573-4a39-4c91-97e6-8645d568f331"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="0aad47a8-37fe-4e31-b47d-753a42ae7794"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="a52282fb-e42a-448c-b3ee-62307739f07e"><mi data-ref="6da4baa5-a391-4468-9535-1a37b5069002">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> — the number of queens and the size of the chessboard.</li></ul><p data-ref="1ed68dc6-6dad-4785-a546-6b2f7efeaf76" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c337c45a-c59b-4f69-8fd2-d5acc048b2d9"></p><p data-ref="fc3d81aa-5456-4c51-96a8-550347d981aa" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="55548f09-a004-4a85-8468-f9c7fd20fd83">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="2a62ef9e-9d00-46d0-87a0-2241dedf9d9f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="e27a8f6f-2cfb-4659-aa25-a8d9a261ff07">If a solution exists, print an <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="4212365d-d10b-4850-b3c2-62f6fac721ef" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="e90aff67-929d-48dd-a08e-c745816f256e"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="1528e8cd-4fa2-4f45-953a-65448c9fd15a"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="a3a1d103-6007-45c4-8879-1af2fe2017c5"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="8eece10e-4436-4579-9ebe-6c6322b8fba9"><mjx-c class="mjx-cD7" data-ref="7502ea23-3c91-4f40-8aaa-a2efe5ee5fdc"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="0fb0f077-8fe2-4900-8bd1-b6533d66b436"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D441 TEX-I" data-ref="45ba4f87-77ec-472f-8c48-234f915dd748"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="526e8069-d74a-48b8-b038-0384972c80b0"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="ef2b0c84-1718-4fe2-9e65-9f3c796297ba"><mi data-ref="f0550891-822d-4f0f-9bd7-ae2552c96c7e">N</mi><mi data-ref="f0c23965-1a48-4a35-9c2c-9f45cd487b6e">×</mi><mi data-ref="b5c6d64e-8270-490e-ac3b-c2cd610c91ec">N</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> matrix consisting of 0s and 1s, where 1 represents a queen.</li><li data-ref="462cbbb4-8f4e-4ffc-98da-4761e1760209">If no solution exists, print: "No solution exists for N = &lt;value&gt;".</li><li data-ref="4e99e679-28cd-41d2-b1d0-f131502566cd">Each row of the matrix should be printed on a new line, with space-separated values.</li></ul><p data-ref="5bd2e8b4-fb0e-4fc5-b4cc-d659cf7ae0cb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="967bb7ac-caff-49db-8029-1eeb8c9f2a0e"></p><p data-ref="4e83b75b-4d42-41ab-bec9-357411f723eb" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="9072d1d3-99d5-4d86-8c94-3040887d0b42">Note:</strong> Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="f5095464-9f18-474a-b4de-7b1d6c999891" data-split-to="f5095464-9f18-474a-b4de-7b1d6c999891" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="4e9d29c6-1b86-4ec3-9c6f-57b0ea64b3d1"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="9a17fe3e-bfee-4de0-a4e6-fb49e05f158d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
