				<div class="pagedjs_page_content" style="column-width: 624px; column-gap: calc(var(--pagedjs-margin-right) + var(--pagedjs-margin-left));"><div><div class="container-xl" data-ref="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-from="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0" data-split-to="d6e4ddbd-9146-4064-bb43-b9293b9bf6a0"><div class="page" data-ref="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-from="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01" data-split-to="f806c3ff-e930-487e-99b9-b6bb883d2e01"><div data-ref="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-id="lab-print" data-split-from="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072" data-split-to="49587887-ab78-45aa-a172-1adbf0f7d072"><div class="ct-print-new-page-after-always" data-ref="f618ee00-b196-4f4a-b99a-dac736485f92" data-previous-break-after="always" data-break-after="always" data-split-to="f618ee00-b196-4f4a-b99a-dac736485f92" data-split-original="true"><div data-ref="71fa5afc-3885-4450-83b8-5810c224af06"><table class="table table-condensed table-bordered table-hover" data-ref="3f3c96e0-337f-4259-b843-06adab6e7040"><thead data-ref="ebd859e1-2287-4c98-9e3d-982e15e0dc46"><tr data-ref="ba7e517b-7d84-4281-b96f-5dd73a67814d"><th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:20%" data-ref="401e778d-dc63-4415-b13c-3e69aca36162" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">S.No: 17</th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:55%; font-weight: normal;" data-ref="e3956cc2-09af-4f7c-b508-aeb875f532de" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Exp. Name: <b class="expTitle" data-ref="c6aaa7ef-ceac-4230-9e0b-03623fb5422c"><i data-ref="805b6c72-a3ff-4449-8fdd-94c1585b1003">Travelling Salesman Problem</i></b></th> <th class="text-left align-middle" style="width:25%" data-ref="6aef196a-c14b-4cc2-b552-643bbc4deeb9" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Date: 2026-10-31</th></tr></thead></table></div><div class="ml-1" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="27a04b08-2aed-4fc9-ab01-0b7481e48e84" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="3bba6b7b-4138-4fe6-ab4e-7ac5a682cbf3" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="9d0b0145-1cec-4692-ac47-8919f2a73ac9"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="76de0864-ad67-4f69-bc3f-60f7dc10cffd"><p data-ref="903e656b-64ee-43bd-9c61-c60a17c64347" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Given a set of cities and the distance between every pair of cities, the problem is to find the shortest possible route that visits every city exactly once and returns to the starting point.</p><p data-ref="a042c522-4f4a-4bce-9728-465b790af3c5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="baf824bc-f1e5-41bc-8c35-5e41af08b4f8"></p><p data-ref="3960ae1e-30fa-4e53-921c-a0eaf704bd43" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="ec13ec4c-2cf3-443b-9bb5-a4ff92c94acf">Example:</strong></p><p data-ref="a78db1f4-e777-4e70-b691-2ab116c9f3ed" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="42ab8b72-2ba6-4c8c-8984-1fa70764de9d"><img src="./adsa_files/71f814c5-2a11-ba16-be1e-3c4e88977575.png" style="max-width: 100%;" data-ref="a243330f-4abd-4a75-9542-bb0a7495fe0b" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"></strong></p><p data-ref="80c1e2bc-b049-4454-84b2-b768cf1558e1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="ea44ab31-5f05-4c9c-b259-639a480426e2"></p><p data-ref="3ef09a1f-187b-4b34-bc37-59c2a795f608" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">A TSP tour in the graph is 1-2-4-3-1. The cost of the tour is 10+25+30+15, which is 80</p><p data-ref="e0f6f56b-e0b4-429d-b49d-4e1ea475fe2f" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8b0a7bae-be74-4106-8745-d5214e504c92"></p><p data-ref="c6592816-1cfe-4351-9b24-6fe4175ea874" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="cd68182c-f33f-47ca-adf8-c90777d20b9b">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="a08e066e-67f6-42de-8a5f-89754c7d7516" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="dbdc33a7-39a9-4c75-8752-52f389f4cc09">The first line contains an integer<strong data-ref="bd90b054-bcb7-4b83-adf9-62f1f7c14bbc"> </strong><mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="aed0ab2f-01e1-4139-b3a2-ab2c2bc0785c" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="840eb4c7-540e-4130-be67-fa72680f1ba2"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="320c4f19-8690-454c-b8c6-261d028b2005"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="3a80d895-3f70-4e2d-ab2c-1df250debf47"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="c6ae47e1-533e-4364-815f-64274d4fb985"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="41743c42-9134-4533-b194-344199cb4d16"><mi data-ref="cba7abee-2f36-4a30-bdda-506f6ea84aec">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of cities.</li><li data-ref="0c735638-d78d-4d66-a941-27661efca237">The following<strong data-ref="fec7cb79-104e-424b-9d40-da84f15c82b4"> </strong><mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="d5fc37a0-233b-423a-98d2-476310a60a95" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="1c201cb5-feac-4a9b-b312-69d1a462587b"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="c8b45223-fe5a-4b6b-98c8-2cea0ba85ecf"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="6b617410-c978-439b-b8c6-0c2d62c9094d"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="ecb3962b-2843-4813-bbdf-dbfde67de78c"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="4f6affda-8e97-46bf-8648-6b6103dc635e"><mi data-ref="073b1e55-1b4d-444b-9a3f-179db5fd0b01">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> lines contain the cost matrix of size<strong data-ref="74369e43-dda6-4f8a-a906-2cf9337b136b"> </strong><mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="b7d429b4-1210-422e-b3a3-c94fb79886b8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="f7fba1dc-ea74-4d12-8d4b-4163d4267275"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="570bffb9-5f66-4165-b621-8fcb0da646d5"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="0f37a1a1-8c2b-463c-a287-9b53944e60e4"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class="mjx-n" space="3" data-ref="f9962620-0428-495a-8933-6df4ac40bd7d"><mjx-c class="mjx-cD7" data-ref="94d22fb6-ae05-4c05-962d-6ab1c1180e1b"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" space="3" data-ref="8bf48a41-5367-4dce-97ed-157b966a70bb"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="28740013-9c4e-47c2-8900-b00094885fb5"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="9cc90ca2-5bf3-4d93-8eb1-6ecdea81f486"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="904e3bba-2c73-4753-8f43-9cab39504f5e"><mi data-ref="53aacd9f-8fa3-4403-b7b0-dba16ac276a3">n</mi><mo data-ref="6c1e5688-2aca-42e5-88bd-1875180edfac">×</mo><mi data-ref="ab467d0d-c12c-4e6e-bd09-350ef35438f3">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>. Each line contains <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;" data-ref="e0f38c7e-192e-4fb6-9017-b4e957d26fbb" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="b099a79d-6120-4b8e-bb45-cbda00a49093"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="ae1bf1ad-5e0a-4310-a0cf-a4b17046b0d0"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D45B TEX-I" data-ref="1453b1f1-7c94-4ab0-98c3-7a95594c7eff"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="801e6ac5-7fd1-4177-9068-65ce4f023acb"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="722522f9-e50c-4870-acdf-bcb9f5252122"><mi data-ref="a7c9a2a5-9c66-416a-9229-0295762b2f57">n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><strong data-ref="a1b55722-da12-46bd-be47-4b45b26c2339"> </strong>integers separated by spaces, representing the cost of traveling from one city to another. If there is no direct connection between two cities, -1 is used to represent infinity.</li></ul><p data-ref="6a23ae41-235a-4414-953f-32a161b86af6" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="23b2a793-4965-4b26-bec1-aca767f2b9fa"></p><p data-ref="b8f7198b-5cad-4349-8dd6-f2cd23034f6e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="50274d3b-47b2-413f-87a1-96f0b740a1da">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="add096bd-5176-41a5-b48f-114e77e92946" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="6f26924c-4909-4bbc-ae2b-3cb9593fb11e">The output is a single integer representing the optimal cost of the traveling salesman problem.</li></ul></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="eba6ed23-49a2-467b-9226-496ae050d3b6" data-split-to="eba6ed23-49a2-467b-9226-496ae050d3b6" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="057fa02a-7a82-4e83-8cdc-d9258e42c67b"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="39351e6d-48ee-42ce-9f86-acaee52a5d7d" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
